<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mth 22.75%, 3-mth 22.76%. [CORRECTED 12:48 GMT]</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mth 22.75%, 3-mth 22.76%. [CORRECTED 12:48 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects 3-mth rate in headline from 2.76%)</p>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased for both the one-month and the three-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.75 percent, down 0.01 percentage points while the three-month rate was fixed at 22.76 percent, down 0.02 percentage points.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
